    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34888" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">per-făcētus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>very witty</i>, <i>very facetious</i>
			(class.).—Of persons, Cic 
			
			<i><span class="en">Brut. 27, 105</span></i>.—Of words: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aliquid perfacetum dicere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Planc. 14, 35</span></i>
			.—<i>Adv.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">per-făcētē</span></b> , <i>very wittily</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">perfacete dicta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. Verr. 2, 1, 46, § 121</span></i>
			.</div>
